silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor#mittensgovernedindividual silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividual is the governed Mittens individual at Tartu Animal Clinic annual vet exam 2026-05-18 — the concrete cat whose storage-identity distinction grounds all Granite specs. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
